# NOTE: bare patterns (e.g. `node_modules/`) match only at the context root.
# Use `**/` to exclude nested copies too — otherwise webui/node_modules (~370MB)
# and tui/node_modules get shipped to the daemon as build context. The Dockerfile's
# node webui-builder stage installs deps fresh inside the image, so host copies of
# node_modules/dist are never needed for the build.
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
*.egg-info

# Node / frontend build artifacts (webui/, tui/) — rebuilt in the webui-builder stage
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.vite/
**/coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo
nanobot/web/dist/
bridge/dist/

# VCS, secrets, local scratch
.git/
.env
.assets
workspace/
build/
